title: Day6_Hephaestus_Intro

tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: Aelius...
Aelius: [Positive] Hello! Oh, uh... what's going on?
Hephaestus: Well, Ares is just over there at a booth.
Aelius: Oh, Hestia must have served him. Didn’t you go talk to him the other day?
Hephaestus: Uh, well... not really, I guess.
Aelius: [Smirk] You didn’t? You realized there was a better way to work this out? That's a relief.
Hephaestus: I wanted to, it's just...

-> Hard? (deference)
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 1>>
    Hephaestus: Yes, quite so. I can craft metal, but crafting words - that is harder. I was afraid to confront him; I had- I <i>have</i> no idea how I could.
-> Intimidating? (humorous)
    Hephaestus: Yes, I don’t want to. I'll admit that. It’s a daunting task, and the  courage I built up was gone soon after I left.
-> A bad idea? (aggressive)
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 3>>
    Hephaestus: I think you may be right, much as I loathe to admit it. Thank you. I was really just afraid of confronting him – maybe it's good I didn’t.

Aelius: That takes a lot to admit, thank you.
Hephaestus: For what good it did, I've still made no progress; and Ares is still strutting around Olympus with no idea.
Aelius: Maybe you could go and talk to him?
Hephaestus: Really? After all that, you think I could? Not a chance in Tartarus.
Aelius: I don’t mean confront him. I mean just, like… talk to him. You don’t need to try to win Aphrodite back, just maybe resolve some of this resentment.
Hephaestus: I just don’t know...

-> This is the only way to move forward; it has to happen at some point.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>
    Hephaestus: Do you really think so?
    Hephaestus: Yes, it seems logical. I suppose nothing can happen if things stay the same.
    Hephaestus: Thank you, Aelius.
-> Well I can tell you Aphrodite won’t like it if you get into a fight with him.
    <<AddHephaestusAffinity 1>>
    Hephaestus: You’re right, you’re right. I can’t be selfish.
    Hephaestus: Thank you, Aelius.
    Aelius: Of course.
-> Okay, just let it stew then.
    Hephaestus: Yes, you're right, I cannot continue like this.
    Aelius: Thank you.

Hephaestus: Alright, fine – I'll do it, I’ll talk to him. But I’d like to eat first, if that's okay.
Aelius: Yes, of course.
Hephaestus: Thank you. I would like <b>Hesperides apple cider.</b>

//COOKING
<<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>
<<StartCooking "AppleCider3>>
<<HideAll>>
