title: Day6_Hephaestus_ReturnPlayful

tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
<<AddHephaestusAffinity 2>>

Hephaestus: Oh... it's very sweet.
Hephaestus: I almost want to stay here and savor this.


Aelius: Hephaestus.
Hephaestus: I know, sorry. I'm going.
//FIGUREE OUT HEPH AND ARES TALKING
Aelius watches as Hephaestus approaches Ares. Anxiety is evident in his every movement, tempered by his newfound determination.
Hephaestus greets Ares warmly, and the outward politeness belies the tension between them.
Aelius watches them from a distance, unable to make out what the two men say to each other. As the conversation heats up, Ares silences Hephaestus with a furious declaration – one that leaves Hephaestus speechless as Ares storms off.

Hephaestus: Oh dear, Aelius, were you aware?
Aelius: Aware of what?
Hephaestus: Aphrodite isn’t in a relationship with Ares anymore, apparently not for a long time.

Aelius: [Negative] Oh, I-
Hephaestus: I should go, I need time to think.
Aelius: Hephaestus.
Hephaestus: What?
Aelius: Don’t you think you should just talk to her?
Hephaestus: Maybe. Yes... *<i>sigh</i>* you're right. Just give me some time.
<<HideAll>>
<<jump Hestia_Day6_AfterShift>>
